## Qué se hizo (2026-10-22)
1. Se eliminaron TODAS las tablas del schema `public` anteriores (profiles, stores,
   products, orders, order_items, order_messages, notifications, coupons, reviews,
   store_events, product_images, product_categories, categories, seller_applications,
   user_roles, admin_audit_log, site_settings y enums asociados).
